title: vadd.f32 of a quiet and a signalling NaN returns the default NaN (FPSCR.DN = 1 on iOS)
ref: A2.7 FPProcessNaNs(): the signalling NaN is chosen, then FPProcessNaN() with FPSCR.DN = 1 returns FPDefaultNaN() = 0x7FC00000; iOS runs with FPSCR = 0x03000000 (ADR 0022)

[code]
30ee201a    vadd.f32 s2, s0, s1
7047        bx lr

[in]
s0 = 0x7FC00002
s1 = 0x7F800001

[out]
s2 = 0x7FC00000
